 786:/home/makro/softconsole_2022/led-hdmi-uart-switches/src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  * The function PLIC_SetPriority_Threshold() sets the threshold for a particular
 787:/home/makro/softconsole_2022/led-hdmi-uart-switches/src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  * hart. The default threshold on reset is 0.
 788:/home/makro/softconsole_2022/led-hdmi-uart-switches/src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  * The PFSoC Core Complex supports setting of an interrupt priority threshold
 789:/home/makro/softconsole_2022/led-hdmi-uart-switches/src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  * via the threshold register. The threshold is a WARL field, where the PFSoC
 790:/home/makro/softconsole_2022/led-hdmi-uart-switches/src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  * Core Complex supports a maximum threshold of 7.
 791:/home/makro/softconsole_2022/led-hdmi-uart-switches/src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  * The PFSoC Core Complex will mask all PLIC interrupts of a priority less than
 792:/home/makro/softconsole_2022/led-hdmi-uart-switches/src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  * or equal to threshold. For example, a threshold value of zero permits all
 793:/home/makro/softconsole_2022/led-hdmi-uart-switches/src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  * interrupts with non-zero priority, whereas a value of 7 masks all
 794:/home/makro/softconsole_2022/led-hdmi-uart-switches/src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  * interrupts.
 795:/home/makro/softconsole_2022/led-hdmi-uart-switches/src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  */
 796:/home/makro/softconsole_2022/led-hdmi-uart-switches/src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h **** static inline void PLIC_SetPriority_Threshold(uint32_t threshold)
